  dir_verinfo_err_noverinfo.pcpp - break step of dir_verinfo.pcpp: a @vi*
  with no @addverinfo (a warning: no version info is stamped, the build goes
  on)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_verinfo_err_noverinfo.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_verinfo_err_noverinfo.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
